---
description: Core rules for the Arthai Health repo
alwaysApply: true
---
- Follow AGENTS.md. Run `make lint test` before finishing.
- Prefer editing existing modules over creating new ones; match existing patterns.
- No PHI. No real identifiers. Use factories in tests/factories.py.
- Data sources, code-set licenses and data layout: read docs/data-plan.md (single source, shared with Claude Code and Grok).
- Output a short summary: files changed, tests added, commands run with results, open risks.
